<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank ups warrants on Hopewell.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank ups warrants on Hopewell.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said it had issued a further 370 million call warrants on shares of Hopewell Holdings Ltd, on top of an existing 420 million warrants which commenced dealing on December 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$4.815</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.098</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  25.NOV.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
